# Requirements workflow

- Story IDs are `M{module}-S{story}`; acceptance IDs append `-AC{number}`.
- Story files are immutable implementation contracts. Status exists only in
  `docs/requirements/AGENT-REQUIREMENT-IMPLEMENTATION.md`.
- Decision status exists only in `docs/requirements/DECISIONS.md`.
- Never implement a blocked/deferred story, an open decision, or a story whose
  dependencies are not `done`.
- Keep exactly one story `in_progress`.
- Implement the complete vertical slice in every app listed in frontmatter.
- Write failing tests before runtime code and map evidence to every AC.
- Mark `done` only after listed full-gate evidence and independent verifier `PASS`.
  The verifier reviews that evidence and must not re-run listed full gates.
  After a FAIL, patch gaps and re-run delta tests, not another full suite.
- Do not add behavior not traceable to the selected story and product source.
